kosmos-samba-mods for Debian

This package enables automatic synchronization between Linux passwords
and Samba passwords using pam_smbpass and enables automatic user homes
sharing with write permission.

It also forces the primary user (first UID >= 1000) to change their password
at next login so that Samba can acquire the correct password.

